{"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Quote the maximum hold for MiniMax camera-controls; nothing is charged.\n\nRequired image_url is an owned starting image; pass prompt plus one camera control\n(free_camera_preset, camera_trajectory with 2-12 keyframes, camera_poses 4x4 c2w matrices,\nor camera_motion text). duration is 3-15 seconds (default 5); resolutions: 480p, 768p (default),\n1080p. Pass the returned cost_rub as max_cost_rub when creating. The hold covers duration + 1\noutput seconds; final usage is settled later, refunding the difference.","inputSchema":{"$defs":{"MinimaxCameraKeyframe":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"azimuth":{"title":"Azimuth","type":"number"},"distance":{"exclusiveMinimum":0.0,"title":"Distance","type":"number"},"elevation":{"maximum":90.0,"minimum":-90.0,"title":"Elevation","type":"number"},"time":{"maximum":1.0,"minimum":0.0,"title":"Time","type":"number"}},"required":["time","azimuth","elevation","distance"],"title":"MinimaxCameraKeyframe","type":"object"},"MinimaxCameraPoses":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"c2w":{"items":{"items":{"items":{"type":"number"},"maxItems":4,"minItems":4,"type":"array"},"maxItems":4,"minItems":4,"type":"array"},"maxItems":2048,"minItems":2,"title":"C2W","type":"array"},"convention":{"enum":["blender","opencv"],"title":"Convention","type":"string"}},"required":["convention","c2w"],"title":"MinimaxCameraPoses","type":"object"},"VideoCameraEstimate":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"camera_motion":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":500,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Optional camera motion instruction when not using free_camera_preset, camera_trajectory, or camera_poses.","title":"Camera Motion"},"camera_poses":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/MinimaxCameraPoses"},{"type":"null"}]},"camera_poses_scale":{"anyOf":[{"exclusiveMinimum":0.0,"maximum":10000.0,"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Camera Poses Scale"},"camera_trajectory":{"anyOf":[{"items":{"$re